ts --filter \"FullyQualifiedName~SiteHeaderE2eTest\" 2>&1 | tail -5","timeout":600000}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01D55hCC1pFuQW4FBy3HSuvy","tool_input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport subprocess, pathlib, tempfile\nsrc = \"src/DcaShop.Web/Views/Shared/_Layout.cshtml\"\ntext = pathlib.Path(src).read_text()\nbreaks = {\n \"DcaShop.E2eTests.SiteHeaderE2eTest--TheLogoLeadsFromAProductPageToTheHomePage\":\n   ('<a class=\"site-header__logo\" href=\"/\" data-test=\"site-logo\">', '<a class=\"site-header__logo\" href=\"/products\" data-test=\"site-logo\">'),\n \"DcaShop.IntegrationTests.SiteLayoutTest--HomeInTheHeaderNavigationOpensTheHomePage\":\n   ('href=\"/\" data-test=\"nav-home-link\">', 'href=\"/products\" data-test=\"nav-home-link\">'),\n \"DcaShop.IntegrationTests.SiteLayoutTest--ProductsInTheHeaderNavigationOpensTheCatalogue\":\n   ('href=\"/products\" data-test=\"nav-products-link\">', 'href=\"/\" data-test=\"nav-products-link\">'),\n \"DcaShop.IntegrationTests.SiteLayoutTest--TheFooterNamesTheShopAndLinksToTheEventLog\":\n   ('domaincentric.commerce &mdash; Built with Domain-Centric Architecture</div>', 'domaincentric.commerce - Built with Domain-Centric Architecture</div>'),\n \"DcaShop.IntegrationTests.SiteLayoutTest--TheHomePageShowsTheSameHeaderAndFooterAsTheCatalogue\":\n   ('<div class=\"site-footer__text\">domaincentric.commerce &mdash; Built with Domain-Centric Architecture</div>',\n    '<div class=\"site-footer__text\">@(Context.Request.Path == \"/\" ? \"domaincentric.commerce\" : \"domaincentric.commerce — Built with Domain-Centric Architecture\")</div>'),\n}\nout = pathlib.Path(\"tasks/CAT-05/breaks\"); out.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\nfor name,(old,new) in breaks.items():\n    assert text.count(old)==1, name\n    d = pathlib.Path(tempfile.mkdtemp())\n    (d/\"a\").write_text(text); (d/\"b\").write_text(text.replace(old,new))\n    diff = subprocess.run([\"git\",\"diff\",\"--no-index\",str(d/\"a\"),str(d/\"b\")],capture_output=True,text=True).stdout\n    lines = diff.splitlines(keepends=True)\n    body = [l for l in lines if not l.startswith((\"diff --git\",\"index \",\"--- \",\"+++ \"))]\n    patch = f\"diff --git a/{src} b/{src}\\n--- a/{src}\\n+++ b/{src}\\n\" + \"\".join(body)\n    (out/f\"{name}.patch\").write_text(patch)\nprint(\"ok\")\nEOF\nls tasks/CAT-05/breaks; cat tasks/CAT-05/breaks/*Products*"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_017o8swCGn6sZ2QvREt2V7Lk","tool_input":{"command":"python3 /tmp/cat05_breaks.py && ls /Users/christoph/Privat/domain-centric-architecture/dca-ecommerce-sample-dotnet/tasks/CAT-05/breaks && cat /Users/christoph/Privat/domain-centric-architecture/dca-ecommerce-sample-dotnet/tasks/CAT-05/breaks/*SameHeader*"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01LyLXDLm5Q8adU5LdR3c5ns","tool_input":{"command":"python3 /tmp/cat05_breaks.py"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01CqfTSkRbGnHfnbHhkL1yDU","tool_input":{"command":"git -C /Users/christoph/Privat/domain-centric-architecture/dca-ecommerce-sample-dotnet apply --check -v tasks/CAT-05/breaks/*.patch 2>&1 | tail -12"}}],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":32,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"I've written the test stage for CAT-05 (adopt mode). All five tests pass on today's code, but none of the five break patches has been checked yet.\n\n**Tests, one per scenario:**\n- **`logo-leads-home`** (browser test, `SiteHeaderE2eTest.cs`): the visitor opens \"Domain-Driven Design\" from its catalogue card, checks the logo reads \"domaincentric.commerce\", clicks it, and lands on the home page with the heading \"Welcome to domaincentric.commerce\".\n- **The other four** (integration tests, `SiteLayoutTest.cs`): following \"Home\" in the header opens the home page, and \"Products\" opens \"Our Products\". The footer text is checked exactly, em dash included, and \"Event Log\" must link to `/backoffice/events`. The home page's header and footer markup must be identical to the catalogue's.\n- **Page objects:** I only added lines. `BasePage` can now read and follow the logo, and `HomePage` has an `OpenAsync` for arriving by a link. `HomePage.cs` still has CAT-04's uncommitted changes, which I didn't touch.\n\n**Results:**\n- `dotnet build` shows 0 errors.\n- `SiteLayoutTest` passed 4 of 4.\n- The browser test passed, run together with CAT-04's home page test (2 of 2).\n- `dotnet format` has run.\n\n**Breaks:** there is one patch per test in `tasks/CAT-05/breaks/`, each changing one element of `_Layout.cshtml`. Each patch is meant to turn only its own test red. The logo break changes the logo's link target, and the nav breaks swap where \"Home\" and \"Products\" point. For the footer I changed the em dash to a hyphen on every page. For the home page I shortened the footer text on `/` only. Running `git apply --check` and a helper script both needed approval that wasn't given, so I wrote the patches by hand. The gate will be the first to apply them.\n\n**Still open:** the browser test's display name is \"Logo leads home\", because the story has no `Title:` lines. The shared-scenarios rule needs that title in the specification's `scenarios.md`, with a Java test under the same title, and I couldn't check whether it's there because the specification was outside this stage's inputs. You own the semantics, so adding it there is your call.\n\nEverything is recorded in `tasks/CAT-05/tests.md`. There are no unit tests, since the plan names no domain rule, and no scratch tests were left behind. The only file outside the repo is a leftover script in `/tmp`.","ttft_ms":2971,"type":"result","duration_ms":242299,"uuid":"dcb26041-eb65-4537-a0cc-41513357809d","ttft_stream_ms":1891,"time_to_request_ms":31,"first_content_frame_ms":1891,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
